  <!-- Addressing Notes -->
  (text "I2C ADDRESSING SPECIFICATION:\n1. A0 is tied to 3.3V, A1/A2 to GND -> Base address is 0x71.\n2. This strictly prevents collisions with the PCA9685 default All-Call address (0x70).\n3. Each AS5600 has fixed hardware address 0x36 and is isolated behind its dedicated mux channel."
    (at 50.8 165.1 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top))
  )
